# Pairs with LastAdminGuard. Check, then write: with the guard only in the
# facade's read-check-write, two removals of different admin entries each
# see two and together empty the set.
MODULE: GuardCheckedOutsideCas
TARGET: LastAdminGuard
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the commit does not re-apply the last-admin guard to the merged record
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
       /\ IF "admin" \in op.sets /\ LiveCount(merged["admin"]) = 0
--- REPLACE
       /\ IF FALSE
--- END